    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p68-q20-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Write an expression for the volume of the box.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$V=x^2(x+2)$",
          "worked": "The square base has side length $x$ cm and the height is $(x+2)$ cm.\n$$\\begin{align*}V&=x\\times x\\times(x+2)\\\\V&=x^2(x+2)\\text{ cm}^3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "p68-q20-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "If the volume is to be $45\\text{ cm}^3$, write a polynomial equation modelling this scenario.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^3+2x^2-45=0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2(x+2)&=45\\\\x^3+2x^2&=45\\\\x^3+2x^2-45&=0\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p68-q20-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Find the dimensions that will give this volume.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3\\text{ cm}\\times3\\text{ cm}\\times5\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "Let $P(x)=x^3+2x^2-45$. Test factors of $45$:\n$$P(3)=27+18-45=0.$$\nTherefore $x-3$ is a factor. Long division gives\n$$\\begin{array}{r|rrrr}&x^2&+5x&+15&\\\\\\hline x-3&x^3&+2x^2&+0x&-45\\\\&x^3&-3x^2&&\\\\\\hline &&5x^2&+0x&-45\\\\&&5x^2&-15x&\\\\\\hline &&&15x&-45\\\\&&&15x&-45\\\\\\hline &&&&0\\end{array}$$\nThus\n$$(x-3)(x^2+5x+15)=0.$$\nThe quadratic has discriminant $5^2-4(1)(15)=-35<0$, so its roots are not real. Hence $x=3$ cm and the height is $x+2=5$ cm. The box dimensions are $3\\text{ cm}\\times3\\text{ cm}\\times5\\text{ cm}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 70
      }
    ]
  },
